      "exactRecovery1FilesReused": false,
      "recovery1Markdown": {
        "path": "/Users/yong/.codex/worktrees/d9b1/lemmadeck/.intentfold/tickets/STEMROBIN-182/tmp/resume182-13/source267-274-author/execution-recovery1/0267/page.md",
        "sha256": "8bc41e254e0c8e79d6fc5a5dbe1f1ca96105d3d08990914a53bb9bb0edb952de",
        "bytes": 1905,
        "mode": "0444"
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "ref": "p0267#1",
          "kind": "p",
          "label": null,
          "owner_exercise": null,
          "open": false,
          "cont": true,
          "samerow": false,
          "box": null,
          "lines": [
            "物体处于 60 米的高度？"
          ]
        },
        {
          "ref": "p0267#2",
          "kind": "p",
          "label": null,
          "owner_exercise": null,
          "open": false,
          "cont": false,
          "samerow": false,
          "box": null,
          "lines": [
            "解　在物理学课程里已经证明，如果不计空气的阻力，",
            "那么垂直上抛的物体的高度可以根据公式",
            "$h=v_0t-\\frac{g}{2}t^2$",
            "求出，其中 $h$ 是高度（米），$t$ 是时间（秒），而 $v_0$ 是物体的初速",
            "度，用米/秒表示，$g$ 是自由落体的加速度（米/秒$^2$）. 我们把",
            "$v_0$ 和 $h$ 的给定值代入公式，并且认为 $g\\approx10^{\\bullet}$，得到：",
            "$60=40t-5t^2$，",
            "由此得　　　　　$t^2-8t+12=0$."
          ]
        },
        {
          "ref": "p0267#3",
          "kind": "p",
          "label": null,
          "owner_exercise": null,
          "open": false,
          "cont": false,
          "samerow": false,
          "box": null,
          "lines": [
            "解二次方程后，求出它的根是 2 和 6."
          ]
        },
        {
          "ref": "p0267#4",
          "kind": "p",
          "label": null,
          "owner_exercise": null,
          "open": true,
          "cont": false,
          "samerow": false,
          "box": null,
          "lines": [
            "在图 59 里，给出了 $h$ 和 $t$ 的关系的图象，这里 $h=40t-↵5t^2$. 仔细观察这个图"
          ]
        },
        {
          "ref": "p0267#5",
          "kind": "fig",
          "label": "图 59",
          "owner_exercise": null,
          "open": false,
          "cont": false,
          "samerow": false,
          "box": [
            685,
            1070,
            652,
            740
          ],
          "lines": []
        },
        {
          "ref": "p0267#6",
          "kind": "p",
          "label": null,
          "owner_exercise": null,
          "open": false,
          "cont": true,
          "samerow": false,
          "box": null,
          "lines": [
            "象以后，我们发现，垂直",
            "上抛的物体在前 4 秒钟",
            "内上升到高度 80 米，然",
            "后开始下落并坠落到地",
            "面. 物体两次处于离地",
            "面 60 米的高度：抛出",
            "后经过 2 秒钟和经过 6",
            "秒钟."
          ]
        },
        {
          "ref": "p0267#7",
          "kind": "p",
          "label": null,
          "owner_exercise": null,
          "open": false,
          "cont": false,
          "samerow": false,
          "box": null,
          "lines": [
            "因此，所求出的根",
            "当中的任何一个都满足",
            "问题的条件."
          ]
        },
        {
          "ref": "p0267#8",
          "kind": "cap",
          "label": "图 59",
          "owner_exercise": null,
          "open": false,
          "cont": false,
          "samerow": true,
          "box": null,
          "lines": [
            "图 59"
          ]
        },
        {
          "ref": "p0267#9",
          "kind": "p",
          "label": null,
          "owner_exercise": null,
          "open": false,
          "cont": false,
          "samerow": false,
          "box": null,
          "lines": [
            "$\\bullet$ 在地球上，自由落体的加速度 $g\\approx9.8$ 米/秒$^2$，这里凑整到 10 米/秒$^2$."
          ]
        },
        {
          "ref": "p0267#10",
          "kind": "foot",
          "label": null,
          "owner_exercise": null,
          "open": false,
          "cont": false,
          "samerow": false,
          "box": null,
          "lines": [
            "261"
          ]
        }
      ],
