      ],
      "sameBodyAsRecovery1IgnoringOnlyFrontmatterFigureLinksAndBBoxNumbers": true,
      "exactRecovery1FilesReused": true,
      "recovery1Markdown": {
        "path": "/Users/yong/.codex/worktrees/d9b1/lemmadeck/.intentfold/tickets/STEMROBIN-182/tmp/resume182-13/source267-274-author/execution-recovery1/0268/page.md",
        "sha256": "bf882e1b2c0247f41aa3c2c7c945bb3039e871580dfe37f31b633db4a942e75f",
        "bytes": 2225,
        "mode": "0444"
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "ref": "p0268#1",
          "kind": "p",
          "label": null,
          "owner_exercise": null,
          "open": false,
          "cont": false,
          "samerow": false,
          "box": null,
          "lines": [
            "我们来看另一个问题."
          ]
        },
        {
          "ref": "p0268#2",
          "kind": "p",
          "label": null,
          "owner_exercise": null,
          "open": false,
          "cont": false,
          "samerow": false,
          "box": null,
          "lines": [
            "摩托艇在 5 小时内沿河顺流行驶 42 公里并且逆流行驶",
            "20 公里. 设已知在整个路程中河水的流速等于 2 公里/小时，",
            "求摩托艇在静水里的速度."
          ]
        },
        {
          "ref": "p0268#3",
          "kind": "p",
          "label": null,
          "owner_exercise": null,
          "open": false,
          "cont": false,
          "samerow": false,
          "box": null,
          "lines": [
            "解　设摩托艇在静水里的速度是 $x$ 公里/小时，那么摩托",
            "艇顺流行驶的速度是 $(x+2)$ 公里/小时，而逆流行驶的速度",
            "是 $(x-2)$ 公里/小时."
          ]
        },
        {
          "ref": "p0268#4",
          "kind": "p",
          "label": null,
          "owner_exercise": null,
          "open": false,
          "cont": false,
          "samerow": false,
          "box": null,
          "lines": [
            "摩托艇顺流行驶 42 公里所用的时间是 $\\frac{42}{x+2}$ 小时，而逆",
            "流行驶 20 公里所用的时间是 $\\frac{20}{x-2}$ 小时."
          ]
        },
        {
          "ref": "p0268#5",
          "kind": "p",
          "label": null,
          "owner_exercise": null,
          "open": false,
          "cont": false,
          "samerow": false,
          "box": null,
          "lines": [
            "摩托艇在整个路程上所用的时间等于 $\\left(\\frac{42}{x+2}+\\frac{20}{x-2}\\right)$",
            "小时."
          ]
        },
        {
          "ref": "p0268#6",
          "kind": "p",
          "label": null,
          "owner_exercise": null,
          "open": false,
          "cont": false,
          "samerow": false,
          "box": null,
          "lines": [
            "于是，",
            "$\\frac{42}{x+2}+\\frac{20}{x-2}=5$.　　　　　(1)"
          ]
        },
        {
          "ref": "p0268#7",
          "kind": "p",
          "label": null,
          "owner_exercise": null,
          "open": false,
          "cont": false,
          "samerow": false,
          "box": null,
          "lines": [
            "根据题意，摩托艇在静水里的速度应当大于流速，就是所",
            "求的 $x$ 的值应当满足不等式",
            "$x>2$."
          ]
        },
        {
          "ref": "p0268#8",
          "kind": "p",
          "label": null,
          "owner_exercise": null,
          "open": false,
          "cont": false,
          "samerow": false,
          "box": null,
          "lines": [
            "方程 (1) 和下列方程组同解：",
            "$\\begin{cases}5x^2-62x+24=0,↵\\\\(x+2)(x-2)\\neq0.\\end{cases}$"
          ]
        },
        {
          "ref": "p0268#9",
          "kind": "p",
          "label": null,
          "owner_exercise": null,
          "open": false,
          "cont": false,
          "samerow": false,
          "box": null,
          "lines": [
            "方程组的解是 $\\frac{2}{5}$ 和 12，这两个数当中只有 12 满足 $x>2$",
            "的条件."
          ]
        },
        {
          "ref": "p0268#10",
          "kind": "foot",
          "label": null,
          "owner_exercise": null,
          "open": false,
          "cont": false,
          "samerow": false,
          "box": null,
          "lines": [
            "262"
          ]
        }
      ],
