      "sameBodyAsRecovery1IgnoringOnlyFrontmatterFigureLinksAndBBoxNumbers": true,
      "exactRecovery1FilesReused": true,
      "recovery1Markdown": {
        "path": "/Users/yong/.codex/worktrees/d9b1/lemmadeck/.intentfold/tickets/STEMROBIN-182/tmp/resume182-13/source267-274-author/execution-recovery1/0269/page.md",
        "sha256": "bd266b97bbfed5f00b69bb4ff0efb0b43c2143686d6b04407c62f39c8ec0c066",
        "bytes": 2379,
        "mode": "0444"
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "ref": "p0269#1",
          "kind": "p",
          "label": null,
          "owner_exercise": null,
          "open": false,
          "cont": false,
          "samerow": false,
          "box": null,
          "lines": [
            "于是，问题有唯一解：摩托艇在静水里的速度等于 12 公",
            "里/小时."
          ]
        },
        {
          "ref": "p0269#2",
          "kind": "ex",
          "label": "873",
          "owner_exercise": null,
          "open": false,
          "cont": false,
          "samerow": false,
          "box": null,
          "lines": [
            "873. а) 两个自然数的积等于 187. 已知这两个数当中一个",
            "比另一个大 6，求这两个数.",
            "б) 把 120 写成两个数的积，这两个数当中的一个比另一",
            "个小 2."
          ]
        },
        {
          "ref": "p0269#3",
          "kind": "ex",
          "label": "874",
          "owner_exercise": null,
          "open": false,
          "cont": false,
          "samerow": false,
          "box": null,
          "lines": [
            "874. а) 矩形的长比宽大 4cm，而面积等于 60cm$^2$. 求它的",
            "周长.",
            "б) 矩形的周长等于 62m. 如果矩形的面积等于 210m$^2$，",
            "求它的边长."
          ]
        },
        {
          "ref": "p0269#4",
          "kind": "ex",
          "label": "875",
          "owner_exercise": null,
          "open": false,
          "cont": false,
          "samerow": false,
          "box": null,
          "lines": [
            "875. а) 两个连续的自然数的积比它们的和大 109. 求这两",
            "个自然数.",
            "б) 两个连续的自然数的和的平方比它们的平方和大",
            "112. 求这两个自然数."
          ]
        },
        {
          "ref": "p0269#5",
          "kind": "ex",
          "label": "876",
          "owner_exercise": null,
          "open": false,
          "cont": false,
          "samerow": false,
          "box": null,
          "lines": [
            "876. а) 直角三角形两直角边的比是 $8:15$，而斜边的长等于",
            "6.8m. 求三角形的面积.",
            "б) 直角三角形的斜边同它的一条直角边的比等于 $13:↵12$，而另一条直角边的长等于 15cm. 求三角形的周",
            "长."
          ]
        },
        {
          "ref": "p0269#6",
          "kind": "ex",
          "label": "877",
          "owner_exercise": null,
          "open": true,
          "cont": false,
          "samerow": false,
          "box": null,
          "lines": [
            "877. 解下列方程：",
            "а) $\\frac{x^2+1}{2}-x=2$；　　　　б) $x\\cdot\\frac{x+1}{6}-2x=2$；",
            "в) $3-\\frac{x+2}{4}\\cdot x=x+5$；",
            "г) $\\frac{3x+4}{5}-\\frac{x^2-4x-6}{10}=-1$；"
          ]
        },
        {
          "ref": "p0269#7",
          "kind": "foot",
          "label": null,
          "owner_exercise": null,
          "open": false,
          "cont": false,
          "samerow": false,
          "box": null,
          "lines": [
            "263"
          ]
        }
      ],
