      ],
      "sameBodyAsRecovery1IgnoringOnlyFrontmatterFigureLinksAndBBoxNumbers": true,
      "exactRecovery1FilesReused": true,
      "recovery1Markdown": {
        "path": "/Users/yong/.codex/worktrees/d9b1/lemmadeck/.intentfold/tickets/STEMROBIN-182/tmp/resume182-13/source267-274-author/execution-recovery1/0270/page.md",
        "sha256": "bc6f0c04b446023e8bbdd8e63ca910188007e60fbc59a445d296834efff1d74a",
        "bytes": 2062,
        "mode": "0444"
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "ref": "p0270#1",
          "kind": "ex",
          "label": "877",
          "owner_exercise": null,
          "open": false,
          "cont": true,
          "samerow": false,
          "box": null,
          "lines": [
            "д) $\\frac{(y+1)^2}{12}-\\frac{7-y}{4}=\\frac{y}{2}$；",
            "е) $\\frac{3-y}{5}=\\frac{y-2}{4}+\\frac{(y-2)^2}{8}$."
          ]
        },
        {
          "ref": "p0270#2",
          "kind": "ex",
          "label": "878",
          "owner_exercise": null,
          "open": false,
          "cont": false,
          "samerow": false,
          "box": null,
          "lines": [
            "878. 求下列方程根的集合：",
            "а) $\\frac{2x^2}{x-2}=\\frac{7x-6}{x-2}$；　　　　б) $\\frac{x^2-6x}{x-5}=\\frac{5}{x-5}$；",
            "в) $\\frac{2x-1}{x+7}=\\frac{3x+4}{x-1}$；　　　　г) $\\frac{5y+1}{y+1}=\\frac{y+2}{y}$；",
            "д) $\\frac{x}{x-2}+\\frac{5}{x+2}=\\frac{8}{x^2-4}$；",
            "е) $\\frac{3x+1}{x+2}-\\frac{x-1}{x-2}=1$；",
            "ж) $\\frac{4}{9y^2-1}-\\frac{4}{3y+1}-\\frac{y}{1-3y}=0$；",
            "з) $\\frac{4}{x+3}-\\frac{5}{3-x}=\\frac{1}{x-3}-1$；",
            "и) $\\frac{2x+1}{2x-1}-\\frac{3(2x-1)}{7(2x+1)}-\\frac{8x}{4x^2-1}=0$；",
            "к) $\\frac{2y-5}{y^2-3y}-\\frac{y+2}{y^2+3y}+\\frac{y-5}{y^2-9}=0$."
          ]
        },
        {
          "ref": "p0270#3",
          "kind": "ex",
          "label": "879",
          "owner_exercise": null,
          "open": false,
          "cont": false,
          "samerow": false,
          "box": null,
          "lines": [
            "879. а) $y$ 是什么数时，分式 $\\frac{y+1}{y-5}$ 与 $\\frac{10}{y+5}$ 的和同它们的",
            "积取相等的值？",
            "б) $a$ 是什么数时，分式 $\\frac{6}{a-4}$ 与 $\\frac{a}{a+2}$ 的差同它们的积",
            "取相等的值？"
          ]
        },
        {
          "ref": "p0270#4",
          "kind": "foot",
          "label": null,
          "owner_exercise": null,
          "open": false,
          "cont": false,
          "samerow": false,
          "box": null,
          "lines": [
            "264"
          ]
        }
