          "lines": [
            "а) $\\frac{xy}{x+y}$，设 $x=5+2\\sqrt{6}$，$y=5-2\\sqrt{6}$；",
            "б) $\\frac{x^2+y^2}{xy}$，设 $x=\\sqrt{11}+\\sqrt{3}$，$y=\\sqrt{11}-\\sqrt{3}$."
          ]
        },
        {
          "ref": "p0273#2",
          "kind": "ex",
          "label": "888",
          "owner_exercise": null,
          "open": false,
          "cont": false,
          "samerow": false,
          "box": null,
          "lines": [
            "888. 用 $t$ 表示 $x$，设：",
            "а) $x=2y+3$，$y=\\frac{1}{2}t-5$；",
            "б) $x=(y-1)(y+1)$，$y=t\\sqrt{2}$."
          ]
        },
        {
          "ref": "p0273#3",
          "kind": "ex",
          "label": "889",
          "owner_exercise": null,
          "open": false,
          "cont": false,
          "samerow": false,
          "box": null,
          "lines": [
            "889. 利用函数 $f$ 的图象",
            "（图 60）解方程 $f(x)↵=3$ 和不等式 $f(x)>↵3$，$f(x)<3$. 函数",
            "$f$ 的定义域是区间",
            "$[-1.5,6]$."
          ]
        },
