      "recovery1Markdown": {
        "path": "/Users/yong/.codex/worktrees/d9b1/lemmadeck/.intentfold/tickets/STEMROBIN-182/tmp/resume182-13/source267-274-author/execution-recovery1/0274/page.md",
        "sha256": "1d61b169f32001b3698b1c26c83b3f2cad5a420d19e0b6116ddcb632a46457e3",
        "bytes": 2883,
        "mode": "0444"
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "ref": "p0274#1",
          "kind": "p",
          "label": null,
          "owner_exercise": null,
          "open": false,
          "cont": true,
          "samerow": false,
          "box": null,
          "lines": [
            "$5x^2-4x-12=0$",
            "有 $-1\\frac{1}{5}$ 和 2 两个根."
          ]
        },
        {
          "ref": "p0274#2",
          "kind": "p",
          "label": null,
          "owner_exercise": null,
          "open": false,
          "cont": false,
          "samerow": false,
          "box": null,
          "lines": [
            "两根的和等于 $\\frac{4}{5}$，而两根的积等于 $-\\frac{12}{5}$."
          ]
        },
        {
          "ref": "p0274#3",
          "kind": "p",
          "label": null,
          "owner_exercise": null,
          "open": false,
          "cont": false,
          "samerow": false,
          "box": null,
          "lines": [
            "不难看出，我们所讨论的方程两根的和等于第二个系数",
            "对第一个系数的比，但取相反的符号，而两根的积等于常数项",
            "对第一个系数的比."
          ]
        },
        {
          "ref": "p0274#4",
          "kind": "p",
          "label": null,
          "owner_exercise": null,
          "open": false,
          "cont": false,
          "samerow": false,
          "box": null,
          "lines": [
            "是不是任何有两个根的二次方程，两根的和与积具有同",
            "样的性质呢？"
          ]
        },
        {
          "ref": "p0274#5",
          "kind": "p",
          "label": null,
          "owner_exercise": null,
          "open": false,
          "cont": false,
          "samerow": false,
          "box": null,
          "lines": [
            "我们知道，当 $D>0$ 时，二次方程 $ax+bx+c=0$ 有两个",
            "根. 我们用 $x_1$ 和 $x_2$ 来表示这两个根.",
            "$x_1=\\frac{-b-\\sqrt{D}}{2a}$，　　　　$x_2=\\frac{-b+\\sqrt{b}}{2a}$."
          ]
        },
        {
          "ref": "p0274#6",
          "kind": "p",
          "label": null,
          "owner_exercise": null,
          "open": false,
          "cont": false,
          "samerow": false,
          "box": null,
          "lines": [
            "现在求出两根的和与积：",
            "$x_1+x_2=\\frac{-b-\\sqrt{D}}{2a}+\\frac{-b+\\sqrt{D}}{2a}=\\frac{-2b}{2a}=-\\frac{b}{a}$；",
            "$x_1\\cdot x_2=\\frac{-b-\\sqrt{D}}{2a}\\cdot\\frac{-b+\\sqrt{D}}{2a}=\\frac{(-b)^2-(\\sqrt{D})^2}{4a^2}↵=\\frac{b^2-D}{4a^2}=\\frac{b^2-(b^2-4ac)}{4a^2}=\\frac{4ac}{4a^2}=\\frac{c}{a}$."
          ]
        },
        {
          "ref": "p0274#7",
          "kind": "p",
          "label": null,
          "owner_exercise": null,
          "open": false,
          "cont": false,
          "samerow": false,
          "box": null,
          "lines": [
            "于是，",
            "$x_1+x_2=-\\frac{b}{a}$；　　　　$x_1\\cdot x_2=\\frac{c}{a}$."
          ]
        },
        {
          "ref": "p0274#8",
          "kind": "p",
          "label": null,
          "owner_exercise": null,
          "open": true,
          "cont": false,
          "samerow": false,
          "box": null,
          "lines": [
            "当 $D=0$ 时，二次方程 $ax^2+bx+c=0$ 有唯一根，这个根",
            "可以根据下列公式求出："
          ]
        },
        {
          "ref": "p0274#9",
          "kind": "foot",
          "label": null,
          "owner_exercise": null,
          "open": false,
          "cont": false,
          "samerow": false,
          "box": null,
          "lines": [
            "268"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "existingAudit": {
        "page": 274,
